@baseUrl = https://localhost:7289
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@serviceTypeId = REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_TYPE_ID

### MF-01: Platform Admin reads the role mapping used by Job view/submit authorization.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/service-types/{{serviceTypeId}}/allowed-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 with service type metadata and role mappings (roleCode, canView, canSubmit).
### Use a non-existent UUID to verify the 404 path. Use a non-admin JWT to verify 403.
